[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:45.524Z ### 6.2 Project Structure
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:45.524Z ```text
