[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:47.244Z ## 4. UI / Interaction Design
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:47.244Z - `src/main.tsx` mounts `src/App.tsx` in React strict mode. `App.tsx` owns `HashRouter`, the error boundary, `AppBootstrap`, and the route table.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:47.244Z - The shell is a thin case-file frame: a compact top bar with the product mark and a contextual back action, a content region, and a status strip for storage and offline state. On phone widths the top bar collapses into one row and secondary actions move into a sheet.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:47.244Z - The visual-direction prototype is a standalone HTML page with three clearly labeled direction tiles. Each tile shows a cork surface, three pin styles, a red association string, a dashed amber provenance string, heading/body type pairings, and one 44px control. No external fonts or images are allowed; the page must work from `file://`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:47.244Z - The prototype is a decision aid, not the app. The human review records the chosen direction, reference games, and any pin/string adjustments in `docs/reviews/style-direction.json`; only then are tokens locked.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:47.244Z - Theme rules: period faces are limited to headings and case-file chrome; body text, menus, inputs, and toasts use a highly legible system UI stack. Motion is short and optional; reduced motion removes pin drops, string draw animation, and auto-pan.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:47.244Z - The update prompt is a non-blocking toast with `Refresh` and `Later` actions. It must not activate while a form has unsaved changes; `Refresh` reloads only after the user confirms.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:49:47.244Z ---
