[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:59:32.880Z 86-- `src/main.tsx` mounts `src/App.tsx` in React strict mode. `App.tsx` owns `HashRouter`, the error boundary, `AppBootstrap`, and the route table.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:59:32.880Z 87-- The shell is a thin case-file frame: a compact top bar with the product mark and a contextual back action, a content region, and a status strip for storage and offline state. On phone widths the top bar collapses into one row and secondary actions move into a sheet.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:59:32.880Z 88-- The visual-direction prototype is a standalone HTML page with three clearly labeled direction tiles. Each tile shows a cork surface, three pin styles, a red association string, a dashed amber provenance string, heading/body type pairings, and one 44px control. No external fonts or images are allowed; the page must work from `file://`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T18:59:32.880Z 89-- The prototype is a decision aid, not the app. The human review records the chosen direction, reference games, and any pin/string adjustments in `docs/reviews/style-direction.json`; only then are tokens locked.
