[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z ### What the prototype contains
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z Three clearly labeled directions:
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **A · The Reading Room Ledger** — warm oak cork, cream cards, Iowan/Palatino heading, oxblood control.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **B · The Midnight Archive** — dark walnut cork, charred cards, uppercase Baskerville heading, light-blue focus ring on the dark surface.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **C · The Field Notes Case** — pale straw cork, bright manila cards, italic typewriter heading, squared control.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z Every direction includes a cork surface; domed, flat, and flanged-tack pins; a solid red inline-SVG association string; a dashed amber inline-SVG provenance string; a period heading over system body text; and exactly one ≥44×44 control. The page also has a “What to judge” legend, skip link, landmarks, descriptive text alternatives for the decorative boards, and no scripts, images, external fonts, or external URLs.
