[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z ### Accessibility evidence
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **Keyboard:** Tab order is `Skip to the three directions` → control A → control B → control C; each control receives focus in sequence.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **Focus:** Every control shows a 3 px outline with offset; dark direction uses a light-blue ring for contrast.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **Targets:** Measured control boxes are ≥44×44 CSS px.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **Contrast:** Runtime-computed body and control text ≥4.5:1; heading text ≥3:1 against its panel.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **Reduced motion:** `pin-settle` animation is present by default and becomes `none`; control transitions become `0s`; final pin state remains opacity 1.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z - **Text:** All sample notes, labels, and legend content are plain text; no user content is injected as HTML.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=FND-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:08:26.043Z ### Known gaps / human gate
