[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z ## 7. Testing Strategy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z | Level | Scope | Approach |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z |-------|-------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z | Unit | Token contrast, route helpers, icon generation contract | Vitest with parsed CSS tokens and filesystem assertions |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z | Component | Shell, error boundary, offline notice, update prompt, primitives | React Testing Library with keyboard and focus assertions |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z | Browser | Style tile rendering at two viewports | Playwright file-URL test |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z | Human | Visual direction choice | FND-HR-1 checklist with contrast and target checks |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z Key scenarios:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 1. A fresh install renders the shell, reaches every route, and recovers from an unknown route.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 2. A thrown route error shows a recovery action and no stack trace.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 3. The update prompt appears only when a new service worker is waiting and acts only on confirmation.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 4. Dialog focus is trapped and restored; toast announcements are live.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 5. The style tile renders three directions with both string types at tablet and phone sizes.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z ## 8. Acceptance Criteria
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 1. `npm ci`, `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, and `npm run build` succeed from a clean checkout.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 2. The app installs as a PWA with valid 192/512/maskable icons and a prompt-based update path.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 3. Every named route is reachable and lazy-loaded; an unknown route and a thrown error both offer recovery.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 4. The chosen visual direction is recorded in `docs/reviews/style-direction.json` before tokens are locked.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z 5. Shared primitives meet the 44px, focus, announcement, and contrast rules; no component hard-codes palette values.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:54.437Z ---
