[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z | [VIS-FR-03](#VIS-FR-03) | WCAG 2.2 AA floor | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z | [VIS-CON-08](#VIS-CON-08) | Targets, focus, motion | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z | [VIS-CON-14](#VIS-CON-14) | Keyboard non-spatial parity | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z | [VIS-CON-15](#VIS-CON-15) | Canvas alternative | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z {"id":"VIS-CON-14","kind":"constraint","text":"Every capability that is not spatial arrangement must be reachable by keyboard through the case list and detail path: create, edit, delete, attach provenance, create and retype connections, search, enter recall, and check results."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z {"id":"VIS-CON-15","kind":"constraint","text":"Expose a canvas title, description, and keyboard-operable text alternative for board contents; do not claim full spatial screen-reader parity or keyboard placement in v1."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=FND-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T19:53:58.326Z The accessibility floor is implemented per feature and audited in the hardening feature. Automated axe checks are necessary but not sufficient; the final human review includes a keyboard and screen-reader spot check.
