[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.287Z ## 8. Security and Privacy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.287Z | ID | Requirement | Priority |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.287Z |----|-------------|----------|
