[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z {"id":"VIS-CON-14","kind":"constraint","text":"Every capability that is not spatial arrangement must be reachable by keyboard through the case list and detail path: create, edit, delete, attach provenance, create and retype connections, search, enter recall, and check results."}
