[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z {"id":"VIS-CON-15","kind":"constraint","text":"Expose a canvas title, description, and keyboard-operable text alternative for board contents; do not claim full spatial screen-reader parity or keyboard placement in v1."}
