[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z The accessibility floor is implemented per feature and audited in the hardening feature. Automated axe checks are necessary but not sufficient; the final human review includes a keyboard and screen-reader spot check.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ## 10. System States / Lifecycle
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ### 10.1 Case Lifecycle
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ```text
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z (no cases) -> demo seeded once -> open case -> [readiness: ready | loose threads]
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z                                       |                         |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z                                       +---- close (only ready) -+
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z                                                                  |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z                                       closed case <---- reopen ---+
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z                                       (still editable; readiness recomputed)
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - A case is `open` or `closed`; `closedAt` is metadata, never a lock.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - Readiness is derived on every read: `ready` when there are zero loose threads, otherwise `loose`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - A closed case whose edits create loose threads displays `Closed · loose threads` and offers close again after repair; it does not silently reopen.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - Manual reopen clears `closedAt` after confirmation. There is no automatic reopen or archiving.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ### 10.2 Board and Recall States
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ```text
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z shelf -> board (pan/zoom/edit) -> capture -> board
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z board -> recall -> draw scratch -> check -> results -> exit (scratch discarded)
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z board -> export -> file; shelf -> import -> copy (default) | replace (explicit)
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - Recall state is in memory only. A reload, exit, or route change discards the scratch layer.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - A case's last viewport is restored on return. Recall entry fits the case to view without mutating the stored viewport.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ### 10.3 Storage States
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - `persistent`: the browser granted persistent storage.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - `best-effort`: the request was denied or unsupported; the UI shows the backup reminder prominently.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - `warning`: usage exceeds 80% of the reported quota.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z - `error`: IndexedDB cannot open or a read fails; the shelf shows a recoverable error with Retry and import guidance instead of a silently empty shelf.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ## 11. Analytics / Success Metrics
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z The app ships no analytics. Measurement is manual and local.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z | Metric | Target | Measurement Method |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z |--------|--------|--------------------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z | Hard gate: one real exam board survives the full cycle | Capture → pin → string → close → recall → export → import → reopen on a real exam | Human acceptance review on deployed GitHub Pages, tablet landscape plus phone and desktop |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z | Would the builder choose it over re-reading notes? | Yes, recorded in the final review | Reviewer statement in `docs/reviews/final-acceptance.json` |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z | Stretch: 3–5 students build a real case and would reuse it | Post-v1 interview; not a v1 gate | Structured interview notes, never telemetry |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z | Board scale | 150 cards usable; soft warning at 120 | Automated 150-card fixture plus human tablet check |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z | Accessibility | Zero serious/critical axe findings; keyboard journey passes | Automated axe suite and human keyboard spot check |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z | Offline | App shell and OCR work after first load with the network disabled | Playwright offline test and human install check |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:08:31.288Z ---
