[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ## 3. Goals and Non-Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ### 3.1 Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Let one student build an exam case from photos they already took, without retyping notes.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Make the relationships between notes, sources, and topics the primary study object.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Make recall practice effortless to start and impossible to score or game.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Survive real exam conditions: offline, on a tablet, across weeks, with an explicit backup path.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Keep the detective metaphor in the interaction and the frame, never in the way of reading content.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ### 3.2 Non-Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Public launch, growth loops, monetization, analytics, or telemetry.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Accounts, cloud sync, sharing, collaboration, study groups, or classroom features.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - AI-generated cases, quizzes, tags, summaries, or suggested connections.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - PDF import, photo annotation, typed note bodies, multi-image cards, card colors, or string labels.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Cross-case card reuse, case duplication, or more than one user per install.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Auto-deletion, archiving, or reminders after an exam date.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Full spatial keyboard editing or screen-reader equivalence for the canvas.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ## 4. Personas
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z | Persona | Description | Key Needs |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z |---------|-------------|-----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z | Exam-focused university student | Primary. Has 1–2 weeks before one exam and a camera roll full of lecture notes. | Fast capture, a board that matches how they think, reliable local storage, a recall check that exposes gaps. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z | High-school student | Secondary. Same product and workflow; no high-school-specific features in v1. | The same case flow with less setup and a clear first-run example. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z | Returning reviser | The same user days later, often offline on a tablet. | Resume exactly where they left off, find a card by title or tag, rehearse without losing the board. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ## 5. Research Findings
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - The product idea was sharpened through a structured interview and recorded in [docs/IDEA.md](IDEA.md). That document already resolves the main scope questions: solo use, local-first storage, photo-only notes and sources, text-only topics, undirected strings, and no scoring.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - The main unvalidated questions are sensory rather than functional: the exact aesthetic reference, the feel of pins and string sag, and whether handwriting OCR is accurate enough to be useful. The plan treats the first two as human-gated spikes and the third as an optional, user-triggered feature that never overwrites the student's text.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - Browser storage eviction is the largest product risk. The mitigation is explicit, tested backup plus persistent-storage requests, not an assumption that IndexedDB is permanent.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z - All technology versions in section 6 were checked against the npm registry on 2026-10-25. TypeScript 7.0.2 is current but is not yet supported by typescript-eslint 8.72.0, so the plan pins TypeScript 6.0.3 and records the constraint.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ## 6. Technical Architecture
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z ### 6.1 Technology Stack
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z | Layer | Choice | Version | Rationale |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z |-------|--------|---------|-----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z | UI runtime | React + React DOM | 19.3.1 | Current stable; DOM chrome and forms keep text, focus, and accessibility native. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z | Language | TypeScript | 6.0.3 | Current version supported by the lint toolchain; TypeScript 7 is deferred until typescript-eslint supports it. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:30.969Z | Build | Vite + `@vitejs/plugin-react` | 8.3.5 + 6.1.2 | Fast static build, lazy chunks, asset URLs for worker/wasm assets. |
