[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z ## 12. Dependencies and Risks
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z ### 12.1 Dependencies
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z - GitHub repository with Pages enabled for deployment; no other hosted service.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z - Node.js 24 LTS and npm in CI; local development uses a current Node runtime.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z - Browser support for IndexedDB, Web Workers, WebAssembly, service workers, and `navigator.storage.persist()`; the app degrades with a notice, not a crash.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z - Bundled English traineddata and tesseract.js wasm increase the precache size; the release budget accounts for it.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z - Human availability for three gates: visual direction, board feel, and final acceptance.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z ### 12.2 Risks
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z |------|--------|------------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | Browser evicts IndexedDB | Loss of exam prep | Persistent-storage request, usage display, once-per-case backup prompt, tested export/import, release docs |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | Large images exhaust quota | Import failures mid-case | Default original cap at 4096px, opt-in full resolution, 2048px display and 320px thumbnails, quota warnings |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | PixiJS gesture or WebGL issues on tablets | Board feels broken | Isolated board chunk, pointer/touch tests, context-loss recovery, DOM list fallback |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | OCR is inaccurate on handwriting | Feature feels useless | Off by default, user-triggered, never overwrites edits, title prefill only, no auto-tags |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | 150 cards stutter on low-end tablets | Core interaction fails | Culling, thumbnails first, texture release, performance harness, 150-card fixture |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | GitHub Pages has no server rewrites or headers | Deep links or CSP break | Hash routing, static assets, no third-party scripts, documented hosting limits |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | Malicious or corrupt backup | Data loss or XSS | Schema and checksum validation, path-safety rules, text-only rendering, atomic import |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:18:32.636Z | Scope drifts into AI or collaboration | Product loses its point | Explicit non-goals and constraint IDs checked in review |
