[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 108:### 6.3 Key APIs / Interfaces
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 109-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 110-- `CaseRepository` is the only write boundary for cases, cards, connections, and attachments. React code never opens Dexie directly.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 111-- `AttachmentStore` reads and writes original, display, and thumbnail Blobs by attachment ID and enforces replace/delete cleanup after a successful transaction.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 112-- `BoardScene` owns Pixi objects and reads a plain board snapshot; it never writes storage. Gesture handlers emit intents to the board store.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 113-- `compareConnections(truth, scratch)` is a pure function used by recall results.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 114-- `computeReadiness(cards, connections)` is a pure function used by closure and badges.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 115-- `exportCase(caseId)` and `importCase(blob, mode)` are the backup boundary; neither touches the network.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DATA-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:28:08.030Z 116-- `useOcr` wraps a tesseract.js worker with explicit start, cancel, timeout, and cleanup.
