[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.162Z ## 1. Feature Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.162Z **Feature Name:** Evidence Capture
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.162Z **ID Prefix:** CAP
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.162Z **Summary:** Imports photos through the native camera or library control, normalizes orientation and derivatives, provides non-destructive crop and rotation, and creates Study Note, Source, and Topic cards inside a case.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.162Z **Dependencies:** Local Data and Case Shelf
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.162Z **Priority:** Must
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.162Z ---
