[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z ## 4. UI / Interaction Design
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z - Capture is a full-screen route reachable from a case: `/case/:caseId/capture`. It offers `Take photo` (input with `capture="environment"`), `Choose photo`, and `Add topic`. The first two use the same validation and processing path.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z - After selection, the crop/rotate step shows the image on a dark mat, a square or free crop frame with touch handles, 90-degree rotate buttons, Reset, Back, and Save. The image is not written until Save.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z - The card form asks for a type (Study Note or Source, fixed at creation), a title, and Save. The title may be prefilled later by OCR only if the student leaves it blank.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z - Topic creation is a small text-only form with title and tags; it never asks for a photo.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z - Import progress shows decoding, resizing, and saving states. Cancel aborts and returns to the case without a card. A failed decode or write shows Retry and Back and leaves no row.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z - Card detail is reachable by tapping a card or selecting it in the list. It shows the full image, title, type, tags, OCR section later, Replace photo, Crop/rotate, and Delete card. Replacing the photo keeps the card ID.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z - All controls are 44px, keyboard reachable, and announce errors; the crop editor offers numeric rotation buttons as the keyboard alternative to dragging handles.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:03.163Z ---
