[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z ## 8. Security and Privacy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z | ID | Requirement | Priority |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z |----|-------------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z | [VIS-CON-01](#VIS-CON-01) | No uploads of notes, images, OCR text, or backups | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z | [VIS-CON-02](#VIS-CON-02) | No accounts or telemetry | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z | [VIS-CON-11](#VIS-CON-11) | Validate imports and prevent archive path traversal | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z | [VIS-CON-12](#VIS-CON-12) | Avoid injection from titles, tags, OCR text, and archive metadata | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z | [VIS-CON-13](#VIS-CON-13) | Release user content only by explicit user action | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z {"id":"VIS-CON-11","kind":"constraint","text":"Validate every imported archive entry, manifest field, checksum, and path before writing; reject absolute paths, traversal, duplicate entries, oversized entries, and unsupported versions."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z {"id":"VIS-CON-12","kind":"constraint","text":"Render all user-supplied and imported text as text, never as HTML; do not use dangerouslySetInnerHTML for titles, tags, OCR, or manifest content."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z {"id":"VIS-CON-13","kind":"constraint","text":"Write a backup or download a file only after an explicit user action; never auto-export or auto-share."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z Supporting decisions:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z - No authentication is required because there is no server and no multi-user boundary. Device access is the security boundary.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z - The case archive is an unencrypted ZIP. The app warns that it contains private notes and asks the student to store it somewhere they trust. Encryption is a future consideration.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z - The app does not log image contents, OCR text, or titles to the console in production.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z - Object URLs for images are revoked when a view unmounts or a replacement succeeds.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z - GitHub Pages cannot set custom response headers, so the plan does not claim a strict CSP. It does ensure no inline event handlers, no third-party scripts, and same-origin assets only.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:44:14.097Z ---
