[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T20:58:56.009Z Cancel is honored until `saving` begins. Once the IndexedDB transaction starts, the import completes and returns `imported`. The UI should disable cancel on the `saving` stage and revoke its own preview object URLs on unmount/cancel.
