[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:10:43.816Z Supporting decisions:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:10:43.816Z - No authentication is required because there is no server and no multi-user boundary. Device access is the security boundary.
