[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:10:43.816Z - Object URLs for images are revoked when a view unmounts or a replacement succeeds.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:10:43.816Z - GitHub Pages cannot set custom response headers, so the plan does not claim a strict CSP. It does ensure no inline event handlers, no third-party scripts, and same-origin assets only.
