[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z ### What was implemented
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z **`cropMath.ts` — pure, renderer-neutral helpers**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Normalized source-frame crop rectangles with containment and millionth precision.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - `normalizeCropRect` mirrors the image pipeline’s edge-clamping semantics.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - `clampCropRect` clamps arbitrary rectangles while preserving their aspect ratio.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Integer quarter-turn rotation: `normalizeRotation`, `rotateLeft`, `rotateRight`, `rotateBy`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Rotation-aware dimensions and aspect: `rotatedDimensions`, `rotatedAspectRatio`, `previewDimensions`, `fitWithin`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Rotated-frame conversion: `cropToRotated`, `cropFromRotated`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Movement and keyboard nudges: `translateCropRect`, `nudgeCropRect`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Output geometry: `computeOutputBounds` matching the pipeline’s integer crop floor.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Reset, equality, and accessible description: `resetCropState`, `cropRectsEqual`, `describeCrop`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Every helper returns new objects and does not mutate frozen inputs.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z **`CropRotateEditor.tsx` — editor**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - `react-easy-crop` stage with a dark mat and visible corner frame marks.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Touch pan and pinch/scroll zoom.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Rotate left/right in exact 90° steps.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Rotation-aware crop-frame aspect, with an optional pinned `aspect` (for example square).
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Keyboard nudge pad and native arrow-key panning on the focusable crop area.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Reset, Cancel, and Save; no storage, repository, network, object-URL, or pipeline calls.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - Polite, atomic live summary of crop percentages and rotation.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.952Z - 44px controls, visible focus rings, semantic fieldset/legend, and reduced-motion handling.
