[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:11:47.953Z The editor is synchronous and has no abort state. The parent owns the preview object URL, the retained original, source dimensions, pipeline execution, and persistence. Invalid crop/rotation props fall back safely rather than throwing; pure-helper callers receive `RangeError` for invalid values. Reset restores the selection the editor opened with: full/upright at import, stored crop on card detail.
