[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:01.930Z ## 8. Security and Privacy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:01.930Z | ID | Requirement | Priority |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:01.930Z |----|-------------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:01.930Z | [VIS-CON-01](#VIS-CON-01) | No uploads of notes, images, OCR text, or backups | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:01.930Z | [VIS-CON-02](#VIS-CON-02) | No accounts or telemetry | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:01.930Z | [VIS-CON-11](#VIS-CON-11) | Validate imports and prevent archive path traversal | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:01.930Z | [VIS-CON-12](#VIS-CON-12) | Avoid injection from titles, tags, OCR text, and archive metadata | Must |
