[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:17.599Z ## 4. UI / Interaction Design
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:17.599Z - The board fills the content region below the top bar. A translucent bottom-left control cluster holds zoom out, zoom percentage, zoom in, fit, and minimap toggle; a bottom-right primary action opens capture. On phone widths the cluster collapses to a single sheet trigger.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:17.599Z - The cork surface is a tiled texture or procedural pattern from the theme. Cards are 240px wide at 100 percent, with a pin at the top center, a photo, and a title strip. Selection adds a lifted shadow and a thin outline, not a color change.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:17.599Z - Pan is one-finger drag on the background; pinch zooms. Mouse drag pans; wheel and trackpad zoom around the pointer. Zoom is clamped to 0.25–2.5.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:12:17.599Z - A touch card lifts after 500ms with a short scale and shadow, then follows the finger. Movement before 500ms or under 6px is a tap. Mouse drag starts immediately. Reduced motion removes lift animation but not the gesture.
