[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z ## What changed
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z ### New capture UI
