[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z   - `/case/:caseId/capture` step machine: picker → validation → crop → card form / topic form → import → return to case.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z   - Separate Take photo and Choose photo inputs accept `image/jpeg`, `image/png`, `image/webp`; only Take photo has `capture="environment"`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z   - Runs `validateImageFile`, shows validation/import progress, opens `CropRotateEditor`, then `NoteSourceForm`.
