[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z ## Acceptance evidence
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - Route is covered through `AppRoutes`; successful saves navigate to `/case/:caseId`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - Both photo inputs share one validation/crop path; Add topic never mounts a file input and never calls the validator.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - Photo cards commit three attachment kinds (`original`, `display`, `thumbnail`); topics have zero attachments.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - Full-resolution toggle is off by default and is forwarded as `retainFullResolution`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - Position is computed from the case viewport, visible viewport size, and existing-card count, then persisted with the card.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - Decode and write failures show Retry/Back with no card written; cancel returns to the case with no card.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - Component tests assert step focus, error focus, accessible names, live regions, and 44 px targets.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - CSS and source checks confirm no raw palette literals and no `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CAP-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:20:45.927Z - Responsive/announcement behavior uses existing token contrast pairs; reduced-motion overrides are present.
