[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z ### 6.2 Project Structure
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z ```text
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z src/
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z   app/          App.tsx composition root, routes, shell, bootstrap, error boundary, focus helpers
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z   domain/       Case, Card, Connection, Tag, readiness, lifecycle, pure validation
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z   data/         Dexie schema, repositories, attachment storage, persistence, broadcast sync
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z   board/        PixiJS scene, viewport, card and string layers, culling, texture cache
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z   components/   Button, IconButton, Dialog, Toast, Field, EmptyState
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z   features/     shelf, capture, cards, case, connections, closure, recall, search,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z                 backup, ocr, demo, onboarding, settings
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z   styles/       tokens.css, base.css, responsive.css
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z   pwa.ts        service-worker registration and update flow
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z tests/          Vitest unit and component tests mirroring src
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z e2e/            Playwright journeys, viewport projects, accessibility and performance checks
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z scripts/        icon generation, OCR asset checks, Pages build checks, bundle budgets, doc checks
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z public/         icons and static assets
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z docs/           PRD, feature documents, deployment, release, reviews
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z The composition root is `src/main.tsx` → `src/App.tsx`, which mounts `AppBootstrap`, `AppShell`, and `src/app/routes.tsx`. Every feature screen is reachable through that router; the PixiJS board is a lazy route-level chunk.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z ### 6.3 Key APIs / Interfaces
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z - `CaseRepository` is the only write boundary for cases, cards, connections, and attachments. React code never opens Dexie directly.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z - `AttachmentStore` reads and writes original, display, and thumbnail Blobs by attachment ID and enforces replace/delete cleanup after a successful transaction.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z - `BoardScene` owns Pixi objects and reads a plain board snapshot; it never writes storage. Gesture handlers emit intents to the board store.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z - `compareConnections(truth, scratch)` is a pure function used by recall results.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z - `computeReadiness(cards, connections)` is a pure function used by closure and badges.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z - `exportCase(caseId)` and `importCase(blob, mode)` are the backup boundary; neither touches the network.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z - `useOcr` wraps a tesseract.js worker with explicit start, cancel, timeout, and cleanup.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=CAP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:21:20.559Z ---
