[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z ## 1. Feature Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z **Feature Name:** Case Board
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z **ID Prefix:** BOARD
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z **Summary:** Renders the infinite corkboard with PixiJS, supports pan, zoom, card placement, fit-to-view, minimap, culling, scale warnings, an accessible card list, and single-level undo for card deletion.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z **Dependencies:** Local Data and Case Shelf, Evidence Capture
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z **Priority:** Must
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z ---
