[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z ## 4. UI / Interaction Design
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z - The board fills the content region below the top bar. A translucent bottom-left control cluster holds zoom out, zoom percentage, zoom in, fit, and minimap toggle; a bottom-right primary action opens capture. On phone widths the cluster collapses to a single sheet trigger.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z - The cork surface is a tiled texture or procedural pattern from the theme. Cards are 240px wide at 100 percent, with a pin at the top center, a photo, and a title strip. Selection adds a lifted shadow and a thin outline, not a color change.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z - Pan is one-finger drag on the background; pinch zooms. Mouse drag pans; wheel and trackpad zoom around the pointer. Zoom is clamped to 0.25–2.5.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z - A touch card lifts after 500ms with a short scale and shadow, then follows the finger. Movement before 500ms or under 6px is a tap. Mouse drag starts immediately. Reduced motion removes lift animation but not the gesture.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z - The minimap is a small inset showing card rectangles and the viewport rectangle. Tapping or dragging it moves the viewport. It can be collapsed on phone.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z - The card list route `/case/:caseId/list` is a full-screen alternative to the canvas. It groups cards by type, shows title and topic status, and offers Add, Edit, Connect, and Delete. This is the keyboard path; it does not claim to place cards.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z - Empty board: a centered case-file panel with `Add note`, `Add source`, `Add topic`, and a short hint about the thread anchor. No dead canvas controls.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z - Delete card: confirmation names the card and the number of strings that will be removed. After deletion, a toast offers Undo for 8 seconds. Undo restores the exact card, attachments, connections, and positions; a second delete replaces the undo slot.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:42.036Z ---
