[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.407Z ## 8. Security and Privacy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.407Z | ID | Requirement | Priority |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.407Z |----|-------------|----------|
