[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.408Z ## 12. Dependencies and Risks
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.408Z ### 12.1 Dependencies
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.408Z - GitHub repository with Pages enabled for deployment; no other hosted service.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.408Z - Node.js 24 LTS and npm in CI; local development uses a current Node runtime.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.408Z - Browser support for IndexedDB, Web Workers, WebAssembly, service workers, and `navigator.storage.persist()`; the app degrades with a notice, not a crash.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:35:59.408Z - Bundled English traineddata and tesseract.js wasm increase the precache size; the release budget accounts for it.
