[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.470Z ## What was implemented
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.470Z **Archive format (`archiveFormat.ts`)**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.470Z - Strict Zod manifest: `format: "notes-detective-case"`, `formatVersion: 1`, `exportedAt`, `appVersion`, `dbSchemaVersion`, full case, cards, connections, and attachment metadata.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.470Z - Reuses the strict domain `caseRecordSchema`, `cardRecordSchema`, and `connectionRecordSchema`, preserving tags, positions, viewport, closure, crop/rotation, OCR fields, `isDemo`, and `backupPromptedAt`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.470Z - Attachment metadata carries `id`, `cardId`, `kind`, `mime`, dimensions, bytes, lowercase SHA-256, and a derived relative path `images/<attachmentId>.<ext>`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.470Z - Manifest cross-checks reject duplicate IDs/paths/pairs, foreign-case cards/connections, dangling endpoints, invalid provenance, attachments on missing cards, and duplicate attachment kinds per card.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.470Z - Filename helper produces `<case-slug>-<yyyy-mm-dd>.ndcase` with UTC dating.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.470Z **Exporter (`exportCase.ts`)**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z - Loads exactly one case through the repository, re-hashes every Blob rather than trusting the stored digest, and builds the ZIP with fflate (`manifest.json` + only that case's images).
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z - Deterministic ZIP metadata via `mtime: exportedAt`; images stored uncompressed, manifest deflated.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z - File System Access save with a Blob URL/anchor download fallback, typed cancellation and save errors, and no network usage.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z - Typed export stages (`reading`, `hashing`, `packaging`) for actionable UI errors.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z **Repository addition**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z ```ts
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z listConnections(caseId: string): Promise<ConnectionRecord[]>
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z ```
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z Implemented on both `CaseRepository` (Dexie, validated reads, sorted by canonical `pairKey`) and `InMemoryCaseRepository`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:44:18.471Z ## Test evidence
