[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z ## What changed
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z **Created**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z - `src/features/backup/importValidation.ts`
