[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z - `tests/backup/importCase.test.ts`
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z **Untouched**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z - `docs/artifacts/BACKUP-2.md` was not modified.
