[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z ## Implementation
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z - `validateCaseArchive` parses the ZIP central directory before decompressing, rejecting:
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z   - malformed/encrypted/ZIP64/multi-disk archives
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z   - traversal, absolute, drive-letter, backslash, and null-byte paths
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z   - duplicate entry names
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z   - entries outside `manifest.json` and `images/`
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z   - unreferenced images
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z   - more than 500 entries, more than 250 MiB total, or more than 50 MiB per entry
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z - It validates the manifest with the existing strict Zod schemas, checks `format`, `formatVersion`, and `dbSchemaVersion`, verifies every referenced image exists, checks byte sizes, and verifies every SHA-256 against the exact decompressed bytes.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z - `importCase` validates before writing, then:
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z   - **copy:** allocates new case/card/connection/attachment IDs, remaps every reference, and recomputes `pairKey` from the new endpoint IDs.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z   - **replace:** requires `mode: 'replace'`, an existing target ID, and the exact target title; deletes the target and its dependants, then writes the archive in one transaction.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z - All records are re-parsed through domain schemas before the transaction. The graph is checked both before and inside the transaction. If any write fails, IndexedDB rolls back the whole restore, including a replace delete.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BACKUP-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-25T21:54:54.087Z - Exported helpers: `inspectCaseArchive`, `summarizeValidatedArchive`, `restoreValidatedCaseArchive`, `importCaseArchive`, `ArchiveImportError`, and the import size constants.
