[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:12:44.036Z import { z } from 'zod';
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:12:44.036Z /**
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:12:44.036Z  * Canonical record shapes for the Notes Detective case graph.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:12:44.036Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:12:44.036Z  * Every record is persisted as a plain JSON-safe object (attachments keep their
