[engine] harness activity stdout task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:44.123Z ## Behavior and measurements
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:44.123Z - **Culling:** 150-card synthetic fixture at 1000×800/scale 1.0 returns 12 visible cards, each intersecting the viewport expanded by 200 screen px. The same margin becomes 400 world px at scale 0.5.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:44.123Z - **Minimap:** projects every card and a viewport rectangle that tracks pan and zoom; tap and drag call `moveViewport`; defaults collapsed on phone widths and toggles with an accessible button.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:44.123Z - **Fit:** uses padded card bounds (64 px), clamps scale to 0.25–2.5, never magnifies past 100%, and applies `applyTemporaryViewport` so the stored camera is not overwritten.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:44.123Z - **Capacity:** 119 → none; 120–149 → dismissible soft; 150–199 → persistent; 200 → blocked. Capture returns the same split-case message and refuses to render the picker at 200. A 199-card case still opens the picker.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:44.123Z - **Texture release:** offscreen card images are released after 3 s; a fast pan-back keeps the texture until the timer elapses. Timers are cleared on card delete, remount, and scene destroy.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=BOARD-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:44.123Z - **Bundle:** initial shell `index-*.js` is 266.16 KB / 84.63 KB gzip and contains no PixiJS. `BoardCanvas-*.js` is a separate 328.40 KB / 97.50 KB gzip chunk. `boardCapacity-*.js` is a shared 0.39 KB module.
