[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z ## 1. Feature Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z **Feature Name:** Backup and Restore
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z **ID Prefix:** BACKUP
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z **Summary:** Exports exactly one case to a versioned `.ndcase` ZIP, validates and restores it as a copy or an explicit replacement, and prompts once per case when the board is worth losing.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z **Dependencies:** Local Data and Case Shelf, Evidence Capture
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z **Priority:** Must
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z ## 2. User Stories
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z | ID | Persona | Priority |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z |----|---------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.080Z | BACKUP-US-01 | Exam-focused university student | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.081Z | BACKUP-US-02 | Returning reviser | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.081Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.081Z {"id":"BACKUP-US-01","kind":"story","text":"As a student, I want to save one case to a file so that a browser cleanup cannot erase a week of exam preparation."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.081Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.081Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:58.081Z {"id":"BACKUP-US-02","kind":"story","text":"As a reviser, I want to restore a case from a file without accidentally overwriting the copy on my device so that recovery is safe."}
