[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z ## 7. Testing Strategy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z | Level | Scope | Approach |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z |-------|-------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z | Unit | Manifest schema, checksums, ZIP paths, copy remapping, replace transaction | Vitest with real fflate archives and fake-indexeddb |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z | Component | Dialog states, replace confirmation, progress, reminder | React Testing Library |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z | Browser | Real export/download, delete, import copy, replace | Playwright with download handling |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z | Manual | Store the archive somewhere trusted and reopen on a tablet | Final acceptance review |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z Key scenarios:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 1. Export one case and prove no other case leaked into the archive.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 2. Reject a traversal path and a checksum mismatch before write.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 3. Copy restore remaps every reference.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 4. Replace restores transactionally and removes the old copy.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 5. Reminder fires once and never repeats for that case.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z ## 8. Acceptance Criteria
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 1. Any case exports to a `.ndcase` ZIP with a versioned manifest and checksummed images.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 2. Import validates everything before writing and rejects unsafe or corrupt archives.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 3. Copy is the default restore; replace requires explicit title confirmation.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 4. Export and import are fully local and show actionable progress and errors.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z 5. The backup reminder appears once per case and never blocks editing.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z ## 9. Open Questions
