[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z |---|----------|--------------------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z | 1 | Should archives be encrypted? | Not in v1; the UI warns and encryption is future work. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z | 2 | Should whole-library export exist? | No; one case per archive. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:25:59.879Z | 3 | What is the archive size limit? | 250 MB total and 50 MB per entry. |
