[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z ## 7. Testing Strategy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | Level | Scope | Approach |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z |-------|-------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | Unit | Manifest schema, checksums, ZIP paths, copy remapping, replace transaction | Vitest with real fflate archives and fake-indexeddb |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | Component | Dialog states, replace confirmation, progress, reminder | React Testing Library |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | Browser | Real export/download, delete, import copy, replace | Playwright with download handling |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | Manual | Store the archive somewhere trusted and reopen on a tablet | Final acceptance review |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z Key scenarios:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 1. Export one case and prove no other case leaked into the archive.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 2. Reject a traversal path and a checksum mismatch before write.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 3. Copy restore remaps every reference.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 4. Replace restores transactionally and removes the old copy.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 5. Reminder fires once and never repeats for that case.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z ## 8. Acceptance Criteria
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 1. Any case exports to a `.ndcase` ZIP with a versioned manifest and checksummed images.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 2. Import validates everything before writing and rejects unsafe or corrupt archives.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 3. Copy is the default restore; replace requires explicit title confirmation.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 4. Export and import are fully local and show actionable progress and errors.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z 5. The backup reminder appears once per case and never blocks editing.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z ## 9. Open Questions
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | # | Question | Default Assumption |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z |---|----------|--------------------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | 1 | Should archives be encrypted? | Not in v1; the UI warns and encryption is future work. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | 2 | Should whole-library export exist? | No; one case per archive. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BACKUP-4 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T04:40:18.386Z | 3 | What is the archive size limit? | 250 MB total and 50 MB per entry. |
