[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:51:20.991Z # PRD: Notes Detective
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:51:20.991Z ## 1. Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:51:20.991Z **Product Name:** Notes Detective
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:51:20.991Z **Summary:** A solo, local-first exam-revision PWA that turns a student's photographed notes and source material into a detective evidence board. The student pins cards, draws association and provenance strings, closes a case only when its structure is complete, and rehearses the connections from memory in recall mode.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:51:20.991Z **Target Platform:** Installable Progressive Web App running in current desktop and mobile browsers; tablet landscape is the primary arranging target, phone and desktop are supported.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:51:20.991Z **Key Constraints:** No accounts, sync, telemetry, AI-generated content, PDF import, or photo annotation. All case data and images stay in IndexedDB on the device. The app must keep working offline after first load.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:51:20.991Z **Historical Sources:** [docs/IDEA.md](IDEA.md) is the preserved product idea and interview input. It is not an execution source.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=BOARD-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T04:51:20.991Z ---
