[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:18:02.200Z - A-B then B-A returns the existing connection and leaves exactly one row.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:18:02.200Z - Self-links are rejected before a write in both repositories.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:18:02.200Z - Provenance succeeds for note/source in either orientation and fails for note/topic, note/note, source/topic.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:18:02.200Z - Retyping changes only `type`; ID and pair key are preserved. Invalid provenance retype leaves the association unchanged.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:18:02.200Z - Card deletion through `CaseRepository.deleteCard` removes both orientations and leaves no dangling endpoint.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:18:02.200Z - Injected `db.cases.put` failure during connection creation rolled back the inserted connection; case `updatedAt` stayed unchanged.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:18:02.200Z - Injected `db.connections.bulkDelete` failure during card deletion rolled back the card and both connections.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:18:02.200Z - Reads reject malformed rows, dangling endpoints, and cross-case endpoints with `StorageReadError`.
