[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ## 1. Feature Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z **Feature Name:** Connections and Provenance
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z **ID Prefix:** LINK
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z **Summary:** Adds the two string types, thread-anchor drag creation, provenance validation, rendering, retyping, deletion with undo, and a keyboard target picker.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z **Dependencies:** Case Board
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z **Priority:** Must
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ## 2. User Stories
