[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ## 3. Functional Requirements
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z {"id":"LINK-FR-01","kind":"requirement","text":"Create at most one undirected connection per unordered card pair by dragging from a card's thread anchor to a target card; reject self-links and duplicates with visible feedback and select the existing duplicate instead of creating another."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z {"id":"LINK-FR-02","kind":"requirement","text":"Support association strings, rendered red and created by default, and provenance strings, rendered as a thin dashed amber thread and valid only between a Study Note and a Source; allow changing the type after creation."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z {"id":"LINK-FR-03","kind":"requirement","text":"Render strings with a visible sag and anchor at card edges, update them during drag, pan, and zoom, support at least 300 strings, and replace draw animation with a static line when reduced motion is requested."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:00.648Z ```forge-requirement
