[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:04.129Z 6:**Summary:** A solo, local-first exam-revision PWA that turns a student's photographed notes and source material into a detective evidence board. The student pins cards, draws association and provenance strings, closes a case only when its structure is complete, and rehearses the connections from memory in recall mode.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:04.129Z 36:- PDF import, photo annotation, typed note bodies, multi-image cards, card colors, or string labels.
