[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:25:04.129Z 56:- The main unvalidated questions are sensory rather than functional: the exact aesthetic reference, the feel of pins and string sag, and whether handwriting OCR is accurate enough to be useful. The plan treats the first two as human-gated spikes and the third as an optional, user-triggered feature that never overwrites the student's text.
