[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Anchors:** right, left, below, above, and offset-diagonal cases anchor on the nearest card edge; edge midpoints are clamped to the facing edge span.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Sag:** 12 px at 100%, 6 px at 50%, 30 px at 250%; clamped to `0.4 × edge gap` (20 px gap → 8 px, 10 px gap → 4 px, zero gap → 0). Curve midpoint is exactly `sag` from the chord midpoint.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Styles:** association 3 px solid red, provenance 2 px dashed amber at 100%; scaled with zoom and floored at 1 px. No text, labels, arrows, scores, or custom colors.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Hit band:** 22 px radius (44 px band) tested with on-curve, near, and far points.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Dashes:** arc-length dash placement along the quadratic curve; association returns no dashes.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Layer lifecycle:** redraws on card move, pan, zoom, and resize; culls offscreen strings with the shared 200 px margin; one stroke per type (association/provenance), so 300 strings batch into two graphics.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Reduced motion:** the layer is static; `isAnimating` is always false and the final geometry is drawn immediately.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Teardown:** `StringLayer.destroy()` destroys both child `Graphics` and is idempotent; `BoardScene` removes/destroys the layer. Browser board drag/context-recovery journey passes with no console errors.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Browser verification (temporary Playwright journey, not committed):** real red pixels `#cf3d2f` appeared at the sagging midpoint (63 pixels), then at the new midpoint after a card drag (71) and after a pan (71); viewport changed to `(-120, 40)` and the string followed.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:02.018Z - **Performance:** 300-string geometry plus provenance dashing measured **1.77 ms** best of five (limit 16 ms).
