[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z ## 1. Feature Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z **Feature Name:** Search Tags and Filters
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z **ID Prefix:** SEARCH
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z **Summary:** Adds normalized tags to every card, client-side title/tag/OCR search, type and tag filters, and a keyboard-navigable results panel that works on tablet and phone.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z **Dependencies:** Case Board, Evidence Capture
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z **Priority:** Should
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z ## 2. User Stories
