[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z |----|---------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z | SEARCH-US-01 | Exam-focused university student | Should |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z | SEARCH-US-02 | Returning reviser | Should |
