[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T05:43:16.685Z ```forge-requirement
