[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z ## 4. UI / Interaction Design
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z - A search field sits in the case toolbar with a filter button. On tablet it expands to a panel from the right; on phone it is a full-height sheet.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z - Typing filters live after 150ms. The panel shows result count, active filter chips, and a Clear all action.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z - Filters are card type (All, Notes, Sources, Topics) and one or more tags. Tags are OR within the tag filter and AND with type and query.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z - Results show type icon, title, matched tag or OCR snippet, and topic status for topics. The list is a single tab stop with arrow-key movement or a standard list of buttons; either way it is fully operable by keyboard.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z - Selecting a result closes the panel, centers the card on the board, and selects it; a secondary Open detail action navigates to the card detail.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z - Tag input in card forms: type a tag and press Enter or comma to add; Backspace removes the last; a counter shows `n/10`. Invalid or duplicate tags are announced and not added.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z - No result state explains that only titles, tags, and OCR text are searched, not the handwritten image itself.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:13.041Z ---
