[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z ## 7. Testing Strategy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | Level | Scope | Approach |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z |-------|-------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | Unit | Tag normalization, search matching, filter combinations | Vitest with card fixtures |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | Component | TagInput, SearchPanel, result selection, no-result state | React Testing Library with user-event |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | Browser | Keyboard and phone search journey | Playwright desktop and phone projects |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | Manual | Whether search finds the right card quickly | Final acceptance review |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z Key scenarios:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 1. Case-insensitive tag dedupe preserves the first casing.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 2. Search finds a partial title and an OCR phrase.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 3. Type and tag filters combine with AND.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 4. Clear all resets everything.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 5. Keyboard selection centers the card; phone sheet does not overflow.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z ## 8. Acceptance Criteria
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 1. Any card can carry up to 10 normalized tags.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 2. Search covers title, tags, and OCR text only and debounces at 150ms.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 3. Type and tag filters combine with AND and clear in one action.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 4. Results are keyboard navigable and select a card on the board.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z 5. Search is read-only and works without OCR text.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z ## 9. Open Questions
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | # | Question | Default Assumption |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z |---|----------|--------------------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | 1 | Should tags be global across cases? | No; tags live on cards within one case. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | 2 | Should tag filters be AND instead of OR? | OR within tags, AND with type and query. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:15.013Z | 3 | Should search include connection types? | No; cards only. |
