[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  * Boundary rules:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  * - No PixiJS import. The scene reads the snapshot and emits intents; it does
