[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  *   debounces a repository call, then calls `markViewportPersisted(snapshot)`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  * - No React component import. The store is a vanilla Zustand store so it can
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  *   be exercised in a Node unit test. React screens bind it with
