[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  * Viewport persistence contract:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:26:21.075Z  * 1. `hydrateViewport(saved)` restores the repo viewport without marking dirty.
