[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:27:02.815Z 286-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:27:02.815Z 287-- A case is `open` or `closed`; `closedAt` is metadata, never a lock.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:27:02.815Z 288-- Readiness is derived on every read: `ready` when there are zero loose threads, otherwise `loose`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:27:02.815Z 289-- A closed case whose edits create loose threads displays `Closed · loose threads` and offers close again after repair; it does not silently reopen.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=SEARCH-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:27:02.815Z 290-- Manual reopen clears `closedAt` after confirmation. There is no automatic reopen or archiving.
