[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:34:45.653Z - GitHub repository with Pages enabled for deployment; no other hosted service.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:34:45.653Z - Node.js 24 LTS and npm in CI; local development uses a current Node runtime.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:34:45.653Z - Browser support for IndexedDB, Web Workers, WebAssembly, service workers, and `navigator.storage.persist()`; the app degrades with a notice, not a crash.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:34:45.653Z - Bundled English traineddata and tesseract.js wasm increase the precache size; the release budget accounts for it.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=LINK-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:34:45.653Z - Human availability for three gates: visual direction, board feel, and final acceptance.
