[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:55:42.984Z ## Implementation
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:55:42.984Z - Pinned packages were already present at `tesseract.js 7.0.0`, `tesseract.js-core 7.0.0`, `@tesseract.js-data/eng 1.0.0`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:55:42.984Z - Copy script copies four files atomically, fails loudly on missing/empty sources, and reports byte sizes.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:55:42.984Z - Asset paths are derived from `import.meta.env.BASE_URL`; external, absolute, and protocol-relative bases are rejected. `workerBlobURL: false` prevents an internal Blob worker URL.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:55:42.984Z - `runOcrJob` uses one global job slot, a cancellation promise, an abort listener, and a 60-second timer. All exit paths terminate the worker, and a `WeakSet` prevents double termination.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:55:42.984Z - `useOcr` owns the abort controller, status transitions, unmount cleanup, late-result suppression, and retry/reset behavior. It never writes to a card.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T06:55:42.984Z - Asset checker validates public files, wasm plausibility, source references to external `http(s)` origins, and `dist/ocr` when `dist` exists.
