[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z ## What was built
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - `ConnectionPicker` dialog with:
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - searchable target list
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - Association / Provenance radio group
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - Save and Cancel
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - keyboard-only create, retype, and delete
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - existing-connection list with edit/delete entry points
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - delete confirmation with Keep connection / Delete connection
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - no PixiJS, canvas, board-store, or Dexie dependency
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - `Connect to…` on card detail and every card-list row.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - `Attach source` on note cards in both surfaces, opening the picker on Provenance with a Sources-only list.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Provenance target rules:
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - note → Sources
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - source → Notes
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - topic → Provenance disabled with an announced explanation
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z   - association always unfiltered
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Duplicate-pair handling: saving an existing pair retypes the existing row instead of creating another.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Parent state updates through `onConnectionCreated`, `onConnectionChanged`, and `onConnectionDeleted`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z ## Keyboard path exercised
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Card list → `Connect to…` → search → choose target → Save.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Card list → `Attach source` → choose Source → Save.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Open existing connection → retype via type radio → Save.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Open existing connection → Delete connection → Keep/Delete confirmation.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Reload → reopen picker → verify surviving connection.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - Card detail → `Connect to…` → Escape → focus returns to trigger.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z - All UI actions in the e2e journey used focus plus `Enter`, `Space`, `Tab`, and `Escape`; no canvas interaction.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z ## Viewports exercised
