[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z ## Acceptance criteria
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.072Z | Criterion | Result |
