[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z | Provenance filters Sources for a note / Notes for a source; association unfiltered | Pass |
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z | Create, retype, delete work without a pointer and persist after reload | Pass |
