[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z ## Accessibility evidence
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - Dialog focus trap and return-focus behavior come from the shared `Dialog` primitive.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - Create mode focuses the search field; edit mode focuses the first type radio.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - Failed save without a target focuses the first available target; error is announced through a mounted `role="alert"` region.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - Target count is announced through a mounted `role="status"` live region and updates on search/type changes.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - Deleting opens an explicit confirmation; Keep connection returns focus to the re-rendered Delete connection action.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - 44×44 target assertions pass for target/type rows and existing-connection actions.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - Contrast assertions pass at 4.5:1 for ink, muted ink, heading ink, and danger text on the dialog surface.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - `connections.css` contains no raw hex/rgb/hsl palette values.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - Reduced-motion rules disable picker transitions/animations.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z ## Shared files and handoff notes
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - `CardDetailPage.tsx`, `CardListPanel.tsx`, and `CardListPage.tsx` now accept optional `connectionRepository` / `loadConnectionRepository` props and lazily resolve `ConnectionRepository` when omitted. Preserve these props and the connection callbacks when editing these screens.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - `connections.css` now owns `.connection-picker__*` selectors. Keep palette values in `tokens.css`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - The picker deliberately renders only while open and is keyed by card/intent so dialog state resets without setState-in-effect cascades.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z ## Known gaps
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - LINK-HR-1 still owns the human board/string feel review; this task did not attempt visual sign-off.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - The full create/retype/delete workflow is proven from the card list; card detail is proven for reachability, focus return, and picker opening.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=LINK-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:10:36.073Z - No axe scan was part of this task; QA owns the independent accessibility matrix.
