[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z ## 3. Goals and Non-Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z ### 3.1 Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Let one student build an exam case from photos they already took, without retyping notes.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Make the relationships between notes, sources, and topics the primary study object.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Make recall practice effortless to start and impossible to score or game.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Survive real exam conditions: offline, on a tablet, across weeks, with an explicit backup path.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Keep the detective metaphor in the interaction and the frame, never in the way of reading content.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z ### 3.2 Non-Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Public launch, growth loops, monetization, analytics, or telemetry.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Accounts, cloud sync, sharing, collaboration, study groups, or classroom features.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - AI-generated cases, quizzes, tags, summaries, or suggested connections.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - PDF import, photo annotation, typed note bodies, multi-image cards, card colors, or string labels.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Cross-case card reuse, case duplication, or more than one user per install.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Auto-deletion, archiving, or reminders after an exam date.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:11:58.561Z - Full spatial keyboard editing or screen-reader equivalence for the canvas.
