[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:38:42.871Z ### Accessibility evidence
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:38:42.871Z - **Focus:** Clear dialog focuses Cancel, Escape closes and restores the Clear trigger, confirm moves focus to the panel heading. Tab order after the panel heading reaches `Run again` then `Clear OCR`.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:38:42.871Z - **Announcements:** One always-mounted polite live region for fill/suggestion/cancel/clear; failed/timed-out states use an alert and Retry.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:38:42.871Z - **Targets:** CSS target floor is `var(--target-min)` = 44 px; Playwright bounding boxes ≥44×44 for `Read text`, `Apply`, `Run again`, and `Clear OCR` at all three viewports.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:38:42.871Z - **Contrast measured:** ink/sunken 13.50, muted/sunken 8.76, heading/sunken 14.25, paper ink/paper 12.99, paper heading/paper 13.49, danger text/surface 8.72, focus ring/sunken 10.46.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:38:42.871Z - **Motion:** `prefers-reduced-motion` disables panel transitions/animations/scroll behavior.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:38:42.871Z - **Untrusted text:** OCR text and titles render as text; no `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`; no raw palette values in the panel.
