[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z ## Invariants and failure modes covered
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z **Search**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - OCR phrases match case-insensitively and return a snippet containing the phrase.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Snippet body is hard-capped at `OCR_SNIPPET_MAX_LENGTH = 160` characters, plus at most two ellipses; a 300-character query still produces a bounded result.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - OCR whitespace is collapsed before matching, so text split by newlines, tabs, or repeated spaces is findable with a normal single-space query.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Cards with no OCR fields do not throw, are not matched by OCR, and still match by title/tag.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Confidence, engine version, OCR timestamp, card ID, position, and type are not searchable.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Search leaves card arrays, tags, types, and serialized card data unchanged; it creates no tags, connections, or card types.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z **Archive**
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Export writes `ocrText`, `ocrConfidence`, `ocrEngineVersion`, and `ocrUpdatedAt` into the manifest card; all four field names are asserted present.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Cards without OCR emit none of the four fields rather than empty strings or `undefined` keys.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Copy restore preserves exact OCR text and metadata while remapping case, card, connection, and attachment IDs.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Replace restore overwrites deliberately stale OCR metadata in the target case and remaps all child IDs.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - A whole case with no OCR restores safely and remains search-safe.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Import rejects bad OCR confidence (`101`), empty OCR text, and unknown OCR fields as `invalid-manifest` **before any write**; table counts are unchanged after each rejection.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=OCR-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T07:44:59.892Z - Import does not invent OCR-derived tags, connections, or card types; restored tag arrays, card types, connection counts, and connection types match the archive.
