[engine] harness activity stdout task=CLOSE-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T16:37:21.631Z ## Key behavior
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CLOSE-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T16:37:21.631Z - Notes need provenance→Source plus association→Topic; sources are never loose.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CLOSE-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T16:37:21.631Z - Topics are loose only at zero distinct connections; status is `orphan` 0, `developing` 1, `solved` 2+ associated notes.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CLOSE-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T16:37:21.631Z - One loose row per offending card: a note missing both requirements has both reason codes but counts once.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CLOSE-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T16:37:21.631Z - Duplicate card/connection rows, self-links, and dangling endpoints are ignored or deduped.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CLOSE-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T16:37:21.631Z - Results are recomputed from the graph only, never stored readiness flags.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=CLOSE-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T16:37:21.631Z - Stable ordering: title, exact title, then id; loose notes before loose topics.
