[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.450Z /**
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.450Z  * One canonical, undirected pair. `fromCardId` is always the lexicographically
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.450Z  * smaller card ID and `pairKey` is the domain's canonical unordered key.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.450Z  */
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.450Z export interface RecallPair {
