[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.450Z   return cardIdA <= cardIdB ? [cardIdA, cardIdB] : [cardIdB, cardIdA];
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.450Z }
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.450Z function comparePairKeys(
