[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.451Z /**
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.451Z  * Canonicalize one connection. Returns null for a row that cannot describe a
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.451Z  * real undirected pair: empty endpoints, a self-link, or an unknown type.
