[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.451Z /**
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.451Z  * Group connections by canonical pair, recording every type present for the
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.451Z  * pair. Duplicate rows collapse to one bucket; the representative type is the
[engine] harness activity stderr task=RECALL-3 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:38:46.451Z  * preferred type present so the result does not depend on input order.
