[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.651Z ## DEMO-1 result
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z Implemented one-time, locally generated demo seeding with no UI changes.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z ### What was built
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **`demoImages.ts`** — draws four 1200×800 notebook-style pages (two note pages, two source pages) entirely on canvas. Each page produces independent original, display, and thumbnail Blobs with MIME, dimensions, byte size, and SHA-256 metadata. No external image, font, URL, or asset is used.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **`demoCase.ts`** — builds the six-card demo graph:
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z   - 2 notes, 2 sources, 2 topics
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z   - 2 provenance strings: note 1 → source 1, note 2 → source 2
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z   - 3 association strings: note 1 → topic 1, note 2 → topic 1, note 1 → topic 2
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z   - derived readiness: ready, zero loose threads
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z   - topic 1 solved with 2 linked notes; topic 2 developing with 1
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z   - 12 attachment records, 3 per note/source
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **`seedDemoCase.ts`** — checks the install flag and case count before generating anything, writes case/cards/connections/attachments in one IndexedDB transaction, sets the flag even when skipped, and provides `removeDemoCase` with an `isDemo` guard and flag re-assertion.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z ### Invariants and failure evidence
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **Graph legality:** canonical pair keys, no self-links, no duplicate pairs, provenance only between a note and a source; tested through `assertConnectionInCase` and readiness derivation.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **Atomic seed failure:** injected a duplicate attachment primary key so the final `bulkAdd` fails after the case, cards, and strings were staged. Observed rollback: all four tables at zero rows and the install flag still unset.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **One-time behavior:** second seed returns `already-seeded`; existing user case returns `existing-cases`, marks the flag, and writes nothing.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **Removal:** deleting the demo leaves user cases untouched, removes all demo rows/blobs, and a simulated reload does not reseed.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **Backup round-trip:** a real `.ndcase` archive manifest carries `isDemo: true`; copy restore through `importCase` preserves the marker and the full 6/5/12 graph; re-export preserves it again.
[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z ### Validation
