[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z - **DEMO-3:** use `createDemoSeedFlagStore()`/`seedDemoCase()` and render the `isDemo` ribbon. Reuse one `DemoSeedFlagStore` per bootstrap. In jsdom component tests, inject `createCanvas` because jsdom has no 2D canvas implementation.
