[engine] harness activity stdout task=DEMO-1 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:56:49.652Z {"summary":"Implemented DEMO-1: locally canvas-generated demo pages, a close-ready six-card demo graph with five legal strings, atomic one-time seeding and demo-only removal, and isDemo preservation through real .ndcase export/import. The exact validation commands pass (17 demo tests; typecheck exit 0); full suite is 945 passing tests.","unresolved":[],"decisions":["Install flag is notes-detective.demo.seeded in localStorage behind an injectable store; the flag is set when seeding succeeds and when it is skipped for existing cases.","Seed image generation happens only after the flag and zero-case checks; a failed generation or transaction leaves the flag unset so a later clean boot can retry.","The case, six cards, five strings, and twelve attachments commit in one read-write Dexie transaction, with attachments last so a failed Blob write rolls back the whole graph.","removeDemoCase rejects non-demo cases with DomainValidationError and re-marks the flag after a successful delete; generic confirmed delete remains safe because the seed flag is already durable.","The demo is left ready-to-close rather than closed; the five specified strings derive topic 1 as solved (2 notes) and topic 2 as developing (1 note)."],"interfaces":["generateDemoImages(options?: DemoImageGenerationOptions): Promise<DemoImageSet[]>","buildDemoGraph(options: { images: readonly DemoImageSet[]; clock?: Clock; idFactory?: IdFactory }): DemoGraph","seedDemoCase(options: { db: NotesDetectiveDatabase; clock?: Clock; idFactory?: IdFactory; flagStore?: DemoSeedFlagStore; createCanvas?: DemoCanvasFactory; digest?: DemoBlobDigest }): Promise<SeedDemoCaseResult>","createDemoSeedFlagStore(storage?: DemoFlagStorage | null): DemoSeedFlagStore","removeDemoCase(options: { repository: Pick<CaseRepositoryPort, 'getCase' | 'deleteCase'>; caseId: string; flagStore?: DemoSeedFlagStore }): Promise<boolean>","DEMO_SEED_FLAG_KEY, DEMO_C