[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.589Z ## 1. Feature Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.589Z **Feature Name:** First-Run Demo and Hints
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.589Z **ID Prefix:** DEMO
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.589Z **Summary:** Seeds one locally generated, clearly labeled demo case on first run, removes it without reseeding, and teaches the thread anchor, long-press lift, and recall mode through one-time contextual hints that can be replayed.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.589Z **Dependencies:** Case Board, Connections and Provenance, Case Closure, Backup and Restore
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.589Z **Priority:** Should
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.589Z ---
