[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.590Z 78-## 4. UI / Interaction Design
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.590Z 79-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.590Z 80-- On first run with zero cases, the shelf shows the demo case at the top with a `Demo` ribbon and the copy `Demo case — remove it whenever you like.` It opens like any other case.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.590Z 81-- The demo is a finished, closeable board titled `Demo Case: The Missing Lecture`. It contains six cards on a cork board with a readable layout, five strings, and a `Closed` or `Ready to close` state, so the student can immediately try recall and closure.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.590Z 82-- Demo images look like photographed notebook pages: warm paper, ruled lines, a heading, and a few legible bullet lines. They are generated at runtime and stored as normal attachments. No real person's notes are used.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.590Z 83-- Hints are small anchored popovers with one sentence, a `Got it` action, and an optional `Show me` that focuses the relevant control. They do not block the board and can be dismissed with Escape.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.590Z 84-- Hint triggers: thread anchor when a case has at least two cards and the hint has not been seen; long-press when the app detects a coarse pointer and a card is selected; recall after the first connection exists. Each appears once per install.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:05.590Z 85-- Settings has a `Replay hints` section with one button per hint and a `Reset all hints` action. Focus moves to the replayed hint and returns on dismiss.
