[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 274:## 10. System States / Lifecycle
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 275-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 276-### 10.1 Case Lifecycle
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 277-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 278-```text
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 279-(no cases) -> demo seeded once -> open case -> [readiness: ready | loose threads]
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 280-                                      |                         |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 281-                                      +---- close (only ready) -+
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 282-                                                                 |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 283-                                      closed case <---- reopen ---+
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 284-                                      (still editable; readiness recomputed)
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 285-```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 286-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 287-- A case is `open` or `closed`; `closedAt` is metadata, never a lock.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 288-- Readiness is derived on every read: `ready` when there are zero loose threads, otherwise `loose`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 289-- A closed case whose edits create loose threads displays `Closed · loose threads` and offers close again after repair; it does not silently reopen.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 290-- Manual reopen clears `closedAt` after confirmation. There is no automatic reopen or archiving.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 291-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 292-### 10.2 Board and Recall States
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 293-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 294-```text
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 295-shelf -> board (pan/zoom/edit) -> capture -> board
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 296-board -> recall -> draw scratch -> check -> results -> exit (scratch discarded)
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 297-board -> export -> file; shelf -> import -> copy (default) | replace (explicit)
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 298-```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 299-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 300-- Recall state is in memory only. A reload, exit, or route change discards the scratch layer.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 301-- A case's last viewport is restored on return. Recall entry fits the case to view without mutating the stored viewport.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 302-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 303-### 10.3 Storage States
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 304-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 305-- `persistent`: the browser granted persistent storage.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 306-- `best-effort`: the request was denied or unsupported; the UI shows the backup reminder prominently.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 307-- `warning`: usage exceeds 80% of the reported quota.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:15.662Z 308-- `error`: IndexedDB cannot open or a read fails; the shelf shows a recoverable error with Retry and import guidance instead of a silently empty shelf.
