[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.585Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.585Z  * Recall is a read-only investigation of the student's own case:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.585Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.585Z  * - The case, cards, and strings are read through the injected repository, the
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.585Z  *   same plain data boundary the board uses. Nothing in this file writes.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  * - The canvas receives the cards but no truth strings. A separate neutral
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  *   scratch layer draws the student's undirected pairs from the in-memory
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  *   `recallStore`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  * - The camera is fitted in memory with `applyTemporaryViewport`; recall never
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  *   schedules a viewport write.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  * - Exit, browser back, reload, and route change discard the scratch layer.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  *   Only the in-app Exit action asks before discarding non-empty scratch.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  * Check computes the pure comparison, announces its counts through a mounted
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  * live region, places decorative marks over the cards, and renders the grouped
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  * accessible summary below the stage. The toolbar stays available for another
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  * check, reset, or exit.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=DEMO-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T17:57:29.586Z  */
