[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z =====
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z /**
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  * The case-board route.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  * The page is the composition boundary between repository records and the
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  * renderer. It loads one case and its cards, builds a plain `BoardSnapshot`,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  * lazily mounts the Pixi canvas, and owns the 500 ms viewport debounce. It never
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  * imports PixiJS, opens Dexie directly, or writes a record itself.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  * Viewport contract:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  * - The stored camera is restored on load with `resetBoard`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:34:39.099Z  * - Pan, zoom, and pinch only mark the board store dirty.
