[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:55:10.646Z - `CaseRepository` is the only write boundary for cases, cards, connections, and attachments. React code never opens Dexie directly.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:55:10.646Z - `AttachmentStore` reads and writes original, display, and thumbnail Blobs by attachment ID and enforces replace/delete cleanup after a successful transaction.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:55:10.646Z - `BoardScene` owns Pixi objects and reads a plain board snapshot; it never writes storage. Gesture handlers emit intents to the board store.
