[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:55:10.646Z - `exportCase(caseId)` and `importCase(blob, mode)` are the backup boundary; neither touches the network.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:55:10.646Z - `useOcr` wraps a tesseract.js worker with explicit start, cancel, timeout, and cleanup.
