[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    * When `true`, matching modules are grouped by which entries actually import them.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    * Modules shared by the same set of entries go into the same chunk, while modules
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    * shared by a different set go into a separate chunk. This way, each entry only
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    * loads the code it actually uses.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    * Example: entries A, B, C all match a `"vendor"` group.
