[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    * - `moduleY` is used by A, B only
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    *
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T19:57:01.807Z    * With `entriesAware: false` → one `vendor.js` chunk with both modules; C loads `moduleY` unnecessarily.
