[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:05:47.308Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:05:47.308Z +The Playwright config uses **one worker**. Measuring frame cadence while two
