[engine] harness activity stdout task=A11Y-5 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:22:07.270Z - **VIS-FR-04 threshold:** at 150 cards the board shows the persistent split warning (`data-card-capacity="persistent"`), and `Add evidence` remains available — not a hard cap.
