[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:13.173Z ## 1. Feature Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:13.173Z **Feature Name:** Responsive and Accessibility Hardening
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:13.173Z **ID Prefix:** A11Y
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:13.173Z **Summary:** Audits and completes responsive layouts, keyboard parity, contrast, targets, reduced motion, automated accessibility scans, performance budgets, and browser compatibility across the finished app.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:13.173Z **Dependencies:** App Foundation, Local Data and Case Shelf, Evidence Capture, Case Board, Connections and Provenance, Case Closure, Recall Mode, Search Tags and Filters, Backup and Restore, Optional OCR, First-Run Demo and Hints
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:13.173Z **Priority:** Must
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:13.173Z ---
