[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z ## 7. Testing Strategy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z | Level | Scope | Approach |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z |-------|-------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z | Unit | Contrast calculations, target sizes, motion state, bundle budget parser | Vitest with token fixtures and synthetic manifests |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z | Component | Responsive sheets, keyboard flow, browser notice, motion toggle | React Testing Library with viewport mocks |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z | Browser | Viewport matrix, keyboard journey, axe, performance, Chromium/Firefox/WebKit smoke | Playwright projects |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z | Human | Tablet readability, 45 FPS, screen-reader spot check | Final acceptance review |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z Key scenarios:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 1. No primary screen horizontally scrolls at 390, 768, 1280, or 1440.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 2. The keyboard journey completes every non-spatial task.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 3. Axe finds zero serious/critical issues across six screens.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 4. The 150-card board meets the CI floor and the initial JS budget.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 5. A missing API shows a notice instead of a blank screen.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z ## 8. Acceptance Criteria
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 1. WCAG 2.2 AA checks pass for contrast, targets, focus, labels, and keyboard operation.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 2. The keyboard path covers all non-spatial work and is documented in Settings.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 3. Tablet, phone, and desktop layouts preserve capability with no page overflow.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 4. Reduced motion is honored by default and by an explicit toggle.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z 5. Axe, performance, bundle, and cross-browser checks pass with documented limits.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:23:17.375Z ---
