urce/topic capture with no dead canvas control | Pass |\n| Playwright keyboard journey completes deletion and undo without pointer input | Pass |\n\n### Keyboard path exercised\n- Focus Delete → Enter → Cancel focused → Escape returns focus → Enter → Tab to confirm → Enter.\n- Post-delete focus lands on the list heading; Undo focused and activated with Enter.\n- Undo restores focus to the restored card’s “Open detail” link.\n- Edit → Enter → title input → Save with Enter → dialog closes and focus returns to Edit.\n- E2E setup used keyboard-only creation and topic capture; no mouse/tap input.\n\n### Viewports exercised\n- Desktop `1440x900`\n- Tablet landscape `1280x800`\n- Phone `390x844`\n\n### Accessibility evidence\n- Dialogs trap focus, focus Cancel first for destructive prompts, close on Escape, and restore focus to the trigger.\n- Changes are announced through the shared polite `Toast` live region; focus is not stolen by announcements.\n- CSS-contract tests assert `min-block-size`/`min-inline-size` of `44px` for list links/actions and the shared Button primitive.\n- Contrast on the list surface: link `9.29:1`, muted `7.87:1`, heading `12.81:1`, danger text `8.72:1`; primary button ink `7.77:1`.\n- Reduced-motion rules cover the new list/empty-board styles; no raw palette literals in new feature CSS.\n\n### Shared-file handoff\n- `src/data/caseRepository.ts`: preserve `restoreCardDeletion` snapshot semantics, original IDs, atomic writes, and endpoint validation.\n- `src/app/routes.tsx`: preserve the list route and repository fallback to board props.\n- `src/features/case/CaseBoardPage.tsx`: preserve the zero-card `EmptyBoard` branch instead of mounting the canvas.\n- `src/features/capture/CapturePage.tsx`: preserve `?kind=` handling when extending capture.\n\n### Validation\n- `npm test -- tests/case/CardListPanel.test.tsx tests/case/useUndoDelete.test.tsx` — **13 tests passed**\n- `npm run test:e2e -- e2e/keyboard-cards.spec.ts` — **3/3 projects passed**, build included\n- Additional checks: `npm run typecheck` exit 0, `npm run lint` exit 0,…[truncated 2247 chars]
