r.\n- All UI actions in the e2e journey used focus plus `Enter`, `Space`, `Tab`, and `Escape`; no canvas interaction.\n\n## Viewports exercised\n\nPlaywright passed at:\n\n- desktop `1440x900`\n- tablet landscape `1280x800`\n- phone `390x844`\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n| Criterion | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `Connect to…` reachable from card detail and card list with visible focus path | Pass |\n| Provenance filters Sources for a note / Notes for a source; association unfiltered | Pass |\n| Create, retype, delete work without a pointer and persist after reload | Pass |\n| Validation errors and target counts announced; focus returns to trigger | Pass |\n| Playwright keyboard journey completes with no canvas interaction | Pass |\n\n## Accessibility evidence\n\n- Dialog focus trap and return-focus behavior come from the shared `Dialog` primitive.\n- Create mode focuses the search field; edit mode focuses the first type radio.\n- Failed save without a target focuses the first available target; error is announced through a mounted `role=\"alert\"` region.\n- Target count is announced through a mounted `role=\"status\"` live region and updates on search/type changes.\n- Deleting opens an explicit confirmation; Keep connection returns focus to the re-rendered Delete connection action.\n- 44×44 target assertions pass for target/type rows and existing-connection actions.\n- Contrast assertions pass at 4.5:1 for ink, muted ink, heading ink, and danger text on the dialog surface.\n- `connections.css` contains no raw hex/rgb/hsl palette values.\n- Reduced-motion rules disable picker transitions/animations.\n\n## Shared files and handoff notes\n\n- `CardDetailPage.tsx`, `CardListPanel.tsx`, and `CardListPage.tsx` now accept optional `connectionRepository` / `loadConnectionRepository` props and lazily resolve `ConnectionRepository` when omitted. Preserve these props and the connection callbacks when editing these screens.\n- `connections.css` now owns `.connection-picker__*` selectors. Keep palette values in `tokens.css`.\n- The picker deliberately renders only …[truncated 2515 chars]
