[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z # notes-detective
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z Turning your notes into a detective story
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z ## Browser support
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z Notes Detective is an offline-first, local-only PWA. It supports the current versions of Chrome,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z Edge, Firefox, and Safari on desktop, plus current iOS Safari and Android Chrome.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z The app checks these browser APIs on load. If one is missing, the shelf still opens and a
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z non-blocking notice names the reduced capability with a link back to this matrix.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z | Capability                       | Required API                                                                           | If the API is missing                                                                               |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z | Local case storage               | [IndexedDB](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IndexedDB_API)            | Cases and cards cannot be saved on this device.                                                     |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z | On-device text recognition (OCR) | [Web Workers](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API)        | OCR is unavailable; cards, the board, search, and recall still work.                                |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z | On-device text recognition (OCR) | [WebAssembly](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly)                    | OCR is unavailable; cards, the board, search, and recall still work.                                |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T20:39:16.391Z | Offline app shell                | [Service workers](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Service_Worker_API) | The app still runs while the current page is open, but it cannot load from cache without a network. |
