[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:42:04.801Z 244-
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:42:04.801Z 245-- No authentication is required because there is no server and no multi-user boundary. Device access is the security boundary.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:42:04.801Z 246-- The case archive is an unencrypted ZIP. The app warns that it contains private notes and asks the student to store it somewhere they trust. Encryption is a future consideration.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:42:04.801Z 247-- The app does not log image contents, OCR text, or titles to the console in production.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:42:04.801Z 248-- Object URLs for images are revoked when a view unmounts or a replacement succeeds.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:42:04.801Z 249-- GitHub Pages cannot set custom response headers, so the plan does not claim a strict CSP. It does ensure no inline event handlers, no third-party scripts, and same-origin assets only.
