[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +## Browser support
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +Notes Detective is an offline-first, local-only PWA. It supports the current versions of Chrome,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +Edge, Firefox, and Safari on desktop, plus current iOS Safari and Android Chrome.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +The app checks these browser APIs on load. If one is missing, the shelf still opens and a
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +non-blocking notice names the reduced capability with a link back to this matrix.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +| Capability                       | Required API                                                                           | If the API is missing                                                                               |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +| -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +| Local case storage               | [IndexedDB](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IndexedDB_API)            | Cases and cards cannot be saved on this device.                                                     |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +| On-device text recognition (OCR) | [Web Workers](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API)        | OCR is unavailable; cards, the board, search, and recall still work.                                |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=A11Y-6 attempt=2 at=2026-10-26T20:45:37.017Z +| On-device text recognition (OCR) | [WebAssembly](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly)                    | OCR is unavailable; cards, the board, search, and recall still work.                                |
