[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z ## 8. Security and Privacy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z | ID | Requirement | Priority |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z |----|-------------|----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z | [VIS-CON-01](#VIS-CON-01) | No uploads of notes, images, OCR text, or backups | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z | [VIS-CON-02](#VIS-CON-02) | No accounts or telemetry | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z | [VIS-CON-11](#VIS-CON-11) | Validate imports and prevent archive path traversal | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z | [VIS-CON-12](#VIS-CON-12) | Avoid injection from titles, tags, OCR text, and archive metadata | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z | [VIS-CON-13](#VIS-CON-13) | Release user content only by explicit user action | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z {"id":"VIS-CON-11","kind":"constraint","text":"Validate every imported archive entry, manifest field, checksum, and path before writing; reject absolute paths, traversal, duplicate entries, oversized entries, and unsupported versions."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z {"id":"VIS-CON-12","kind":"constraint","text":"Render all user-supplied and imported text as text, never as HTML; do not use dangerouslySetInnerHTML for titles, tags, OCR, or manifest content."}
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z ```forge-requirement
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-2 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:06:33.093Z {"id":"VIS-CON-13","kind":"constraint","text":"Write a backup or download a file only after an explicit user action; never auto-export or auto-share."}
