[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z # PRD: Notes Detective
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z ## 1. Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z **Product Name:** Notes Detective
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z **Summary:** A solo, local-first exam-revision PWA that turns a student's photographed notes and source material into a detective evidence board. The student pins cards, draws association and provenance strings, closes a case only when its structure is complete, and rehearses the connections from memory in recall mode.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z **Target Platform:** Installable Progressive Web App running in current desktop and mobile browsers; tablet landscape is the primary arranging target, phone and desktop are supported.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z **Key Constraints:** No accounts, sync, telemetry, AI-generated content, PDF import, or photo annotation. All case data and images stay in IndexedDB on the device. The app must keep working offline after first load.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z **Historical Sources:** [docs/IDEA.md](IDEA.md) is the preserved product idea and interview input. It is not an execution source.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z ## 2. Version History
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z | Version | Date | Author | Changes |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z |---------|------|--------|---------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.400Z | 1.0 | 2026-10-25 | Product interview with project owner | Initial canonical PRD and 13 features |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ## 3. Goals and Non-Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ### 3.1 Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Let one student build an exam case from photos they already took, without retyping notes.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Make the relationships between notes, sources, and topics the primary study object.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Make recall practice effortless to start and impossible to score or game.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Survive real exam conditions: offline, on a tablet, across weeks, with an explicit backup path.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Keep the detective metaphor in the interaction and the frame, never in the way of reading content.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ### 3.2 Non-Goals
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Public launch, growth loops, monetization, analytics, or telemetry.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Accounts, cloud sync, sharing, collaboration, study groups, or classroom features.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - AI-generated cases, quizzes, tags, summaries, or suggested connections.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - PDF import, photo annotation, typed note bodies, multi-image cards, card colors, or string labels.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Cross-case card reuse, case duplication, or more than one user per install.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Auto-deletion, archiving, or reminders after an exam date.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Full spatial keyboard editing or screen-reader equivalence for the canvas.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ## 4. Personas
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z | Persona | Description | Key Needs |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z |---------|-------------|-----------|
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z | Exam-focused university student | Primary. Has 1–2 weeks before one exam and a camera roll full of lecture notes. | Fast capture, a board that matches how they think, reliable local storage, a recall check that exposes gaps. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z | High-school student | Secondary. Same product and workflow; no high-school-specific features in v1. | The same case flow with less setup and a clear first-run example. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z | Returning reviser | The same user days later, often offline on a tablet. | Resume exactly where they left off, find a card by title or tag, rehearse without losing the board. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ## 5. Research Findings
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - The product idea was sharpened through a structured interview and recorded in [docs/IDEA.md](IDEA.md). That document already resolves the main scope questions: solo use, local-first storage, photo-only notes and sources, text-only topics, undirected strings, and no scoring.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - The main unvalidated questions are sensory rather than functional: the exact aesthetic reference, the feel of pins and string sag, and whether handwriting OCR is accurate enough to be useful. The plan treats the first two as human-gated spikes and the third as an optional, user-triggered feature that never overwrites the student's text.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - Browser storage eviction is the largest product risk. The mitigation is explicit, tested backup plus persistent-storage requests, not an assumption that IndexedDB is permanent.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z - All technology versions in section 6 were checked against the npm registry on 2026-10-25. TypeScript 7.0.2 is current but is not yet supported by typescript-eslint 8.72.0, so the plan pins TypeScript 6.0.3 and records the constraint.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ---
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z === S11 ===
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z ## 11. Analytics / Success Metrics
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z The app ships no analytics. Measurement is manual and local.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:03.401Z | Metric | Target | Measurement Method |
