[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z ## 1. Feature Overview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z **Feature Name:** Backup and Restore
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z **ID Prefix:** BACKUP
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z **Summary:** Exports exactly one case to a versioned `.ndcase` ZIP, validates and restores it as a copy or an explicit replacement, and prompts once per case when the board is worth losing.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z **Dependencies:** Local Data and Case Shelf, Evidence Capture
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z **Priority:** Must
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z ---
