[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z | BACKUP-US-01 | Exam-focused university student | Must |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z | BACKUP-US-02 | Returning reviser | Must |
