[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z ## 4. UI / Interaction Design
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z - Export is available from a case and from the shelf row menu. It opens a save dialog or triggers a download named `<case-slug>-<yyyy-mm-dd>.ndcase`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.188Z - Import is available from the shelf. The file picker accepts `.ndcase`. After validation, a summary shows case title, card count, connection count, image count, and exported date.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.189Z - Default action is `Restore as a copy`. If an archived case ID already exists, a secondary `Replace existing case` option appears with the existing title and requires a typed confirmation.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:35:25.189Z - Progress is stage-based: Reading archive, Checking integrity, Restoring images, Restoring cards, Done. Errors name the failed stage and keep the existing data untouched.
