[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z - ## browser support
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + # notes detective
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + notes detective is an installable, offline-first exam-revision pwa. it turns photographed
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + lecture notes, sources, and topics into a detective evidence board: pin cards, draw association
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + and provenance strings, close a case only when its structure is complete, and rehearse the
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + connections from memory in recall mode.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + everything runs in the browser on the device. there is no account, backend, upload, telemetry,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + or remote copy of a case.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + ## what this is
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **evidence capture.** import photos, crop and rotate them, and attach them to study note,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +   source, or topic cards.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **case board.** pan and zoom a cork board, pin cards, and draw undirected strings with an
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +   association or provenance type.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **closure.** a case is ready to close when every study note has provenance to a source and an
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +   association to a topic. closing records a state; it never locks editing.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **recall.** hide the truth strings, redraw connections on a scratch layer, and check for
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +   remembered, missed, extra, and type-mismatched pairs. there is no score, percentage, or grade.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **search and tags.** find cards by title, tag, or stored ocr text.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **backup and restore.** export one case to a versioned `.ndcase` zip and restore it as a copy or
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +   an explicit replacement.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **optional ocr.** run bundled english text recognition on the device. ocr is user-triggered and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +   only suggests a title; it never overwrites an edit.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **first-run demo.** a clearly labeled demo case is seeded once when the install has no cases, so
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +   the board, strings, closure, and recall can be tried immediately.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + - **offline app shell.** after the first successful load, the shelf, board, recall, search, and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +   ocr assets load from the service-worker cache.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + ## requirements
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + | requirement | detail                                                                                                                                                       |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.707Z + | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + | node.js     | node 24 lts is the pinned release toolchain (`.nvmrc` contains `24`). the package also accepts node 22.12 and newer, but ci and deployment use node 24.      |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + | npm         | installs from the committed `package-lock.json` with `npm ci`.                                                                                               |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + | disk space  | dependencies, playwright browsers, and the bundled ocr worker, wasm, and english traineddata.                                                                |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + | browser     | a current browser with indexeddb. service workers, web workers, and webassembly unlock offline and ocr behavior; missing apis produce a notice, not a crash. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + | hosting     | github pages for the deployed site. no server, database, authentication service, function, or secret is required.                                            |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + the ocr assets are copied into `public/ocr` by `scripts/copy-ocr-assets.mjs` from the pinned
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + `tesseract.js`, `tesseract.js-core`, and `@tesseract.js-data/eng` packages. `postinstall`,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + `predev`, and `prebuild` run that copy automatically.
