[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ## install
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + clone the repository, then run the following from its root:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```bash
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm ci
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npx playwright install --with-deps chromium firefox webkit
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + `npm ci` installs exactly the lockfile versions and runs the ocr asset copy. the playwright install
