[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + open <http://localhost:5173/>. the first run seeds the demo case when the browser profile has no
