[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ## quality checks
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + run the release checks in this order. the pages and bundle checks read build output, so build
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + first.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```bash
