[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm run lint
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm run typecheck
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm run test:coverage
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm run build
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm run test:e2e
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + node scripts/perf-budget.mjs
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + node scripts/check-bundle-budget.mjs
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + node scripts/check-release-docs.mjs
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + for the github pages base path, use the exact build and checker shown under
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + [production preview](#production-preview).
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + what the checks enforce:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + - **coverage:** `src/domain/**` and `src/data/**` must each reach at least 85 percent line
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +   coverage, and every matched file must be covered. a new domain or data file with no test fails
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +   the threshold even if the directory average is healthy.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + - **initial javascript:** at or below 300 kib gzip for the vite entry plus its static imports. lazy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +   board and ocr chunks are outside that budget.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + - **service-worker precache:** at or below 25 mib for every precached shell, icon, lazy chunk, and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +   ocr asset.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + - **pages artifact:** every built asset stays inside the configured base path, the manifest and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +   icons exist, and `start_url`/`scope` stay relative.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + - **release docs:** required headings, local links, documented commands, and no unfinished
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +   placeholder text.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ci runs the same gate on node 24 for every push and pull request: `npm ci`, workflow validation,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + lint, typecheck, coverage, build, playwright browser installation for chromium, firefox, and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + webkit, and the playwright end-to-end suite. a pull request never deploys.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ## production preview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + build the production artifact, then serve it with vite preview. the dev server is not a substitute.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ### default relative build
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```bash
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm ci
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm run build
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm run preview
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + open <http://localhost:4173/>. a direct hash route such as <http://localhost:4173/#/settings> loads
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + without a server rewrite because every route lives after `#`.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ### github pages base-path build
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + use the same base path for the build, the preview server, and the checker:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```bash
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + vite_base_path=/notes-detective/ npm run build
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + npm run preview -- --base /notes-detective/
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + node scripts/check-pages-build.mjs --base /notes-detective/
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + ```
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + open <http://localhost:4173/notes-detective/> and then a direct route such as
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.708Z + <http://localhost:4173/notes-detective/#/settings>. if the repository has a different name,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + substitute that name consistently in `vite_base_path` and `--base`; the deploy workflow derives it
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + from the repository automatically.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + `vite_base_path` is build-time only. changing it after a build has no effect; rebuild before
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + previewing or deploying. the full base-path contract, one-time pages setup, and troubleshooting
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + table are in [docs/deployment.md](docs/deployment.md).
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + ## deploy to github pages
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + deployment is automatic and main-only. `.github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml` runs on a push to
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + `main`, builds with `vite_base_path` set to the repository name, runs
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + `node scripts/check-pages-build.mjs`, uploads `dist/` as the pages artifact, and deploys it through
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + the `github-pages` environment. pull requests run ci and never deploy.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + one-time repository setup:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + 1. open **settings → pages**.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + 2. under **build and deployment → source**, choose **github actions**.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + 3. keep `main` as the deployment branch and require the **quality gate (node 24)** status check on
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +    pull requests.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + 4. optionally add protection rules to the `github-pages` environment.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + github pages serves a project site at `https://account.github.io/repository/`, where `account` and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + `repository` are the account and repository names. a hash route such as
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + `https://account.github.io/repository/#/settings` loads directly; a path-style url such as
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + `/repository/settings` is not supported and does not need to be.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + the workflow uses narrow permissions (`contents: read`, `pages: write`, `id-[REDACTED] and no
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + repository secret. the static host cannot set custom response headers, so the project does not
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + claim a custom header policy. deployment proves that the artifact built with the right base path
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + and passed the pages check; it does not prove that the product is useful or that the human
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + acceptance journey passed.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + step-by-step deployment details and failure symptoms are in
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + [docs/deployment.md](docs/deployment.md). the release gate is in
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + [docs/release.md](docs/release.md).
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + ## data and privacy
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + notes detective stores everything locally in indexeddb:
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + | store         | contents                                                                                         |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + | `cases`       | case title, subject, exam date, closure state, viewport, demo marker, and backup reminder state. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + | `cards`       | study note, source, and topic records, positions, ocr text and confidence, and timestamps.       |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + | `connections` | association and provenance strings with their endpoint card ids.                                 |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + | `attachments` | original, display, and thumbnail image blobs for the cards in the case.                          |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + the database is `notes-detective`, schema version 1, created and migrated by dexie. image bytes,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + card titles, tags, ocr text, and backup files are never uploaded. ocr runs in a bundled web worker
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + with bundled wasm and english traineddata, using same-origin assets. there is no analytics,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + telemetry, crash reporting, advertising sdk, cdn font, or third-party runtime script.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + the browser requests the static app files from github pages, as it would for any website. those
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + requests contain ordinary http metadata; they never contain case content, image bytes, or ocr text.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + the app asks for persistent storage when the first case is created and shows whether storage is
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + persistent or best effort. persistence is a request, not a guarantee: the browser can still evict
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + site data. export important cases.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + there is no account, server database, authentication service, or multi-device copy. the device and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + browser profile are the boundary.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + ## backup and restore
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + export one case from the case screen or the shelf row menu. the file is named
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + `<case-slug>-<yyyy-mm-dd>.ndcase` and is a zip containing `manifest.json` plus the case's image
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + attachments. the manifest records the archive format version, database schema version, app version,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + case, cards, connections, tags, positions, closure state, and ocr fields. every image entry has a
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + sha-256 checksum and a safe relative path.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + import from the shelf. before writing anything, the app validates the zip structure, manifest
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + schema and versions, checksums, paths, entry count, entry sizes, and duplicate names. the default
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + restore action is **restore as a copy**, which assigns new ids and leaves existing cases untouched.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + replacing an existing case by id requires an explicit **replace existing case** choice and a typed
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + confirmation, and the replacement is transactional. a failed import leaves the existing shelf
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + unchanged.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + the archive is a plain zip file. it is not protected by a password, so anyone who obtains the file
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + can read the notes inside. store backups somewhere you trust and delete old copies when they are no
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + longer needed. there is no whole-library export in v1: each archive contains exactly one case.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + after a case reaches five cards and one connection, a non-blocking reminder offers a backup once
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + for that case. **back up now** exports it; **not now** dismisses the reminder for that case
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + permanently. the reminder never blocks editing.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.709Z + ## supported browsers and devices
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + the primary arranging target is a 10-inch tablet in landscape. phone and desktop support the full
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + feature set, not a reduced one.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + | device                    | viewport | expectation                                                                                        |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + | ------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + | 10-inch tablet, landscape | 1280x800 | primary board layout; no page-level horizontal scrolling; touch targets at least 44x44 css pixels. |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + | phone                     | 390x844  | full capability with bottom sheets and compact board controls.                                     |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + | desktop                   | 1440x900 | full capability, pointer board, and the complete keyboard path for non-spatial tasks.              |
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +
