[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + installation is browser-native. on android chrome and desktop chromium browsers, use the install
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + prompt or the browser menu. on ios safari, use **share → add to home screen**. after the first
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + successful load, the installed app opens from the service-worker cache and can reload offline.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + ## known limitations
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + - **spatial editing is pointer-only.** placing, panning, and scratch drawing on the board require a
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +   pointer. the card list, card detail, connection picker, search, and recall results are
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +   keyboard-operable alternatives for the non-spatial work; they do not reproduce the spatial
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +   canvas. the board has an accessible name, description, and a visible **open card list** action.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + - **ocr is english-only and handwriting-dependent.** recognition is user-triggered, runs locally,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +   and only pre-fills a title suggestion. accuracy on handwriting varies and can be poor.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + - **backups are plain zip files.** they are not protected by a password. treat a `.ndcase` file as
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +   private notes.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + - **storage can be evicted.** persistent storage is best-effort, not permanent. export important
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +   cases.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z + - **first load needs a network.** offline behavior starts after the first successful load and
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.710Z +   service-worker install. there is no offline installer.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z + - **github pages is static.** there is no backend, server rewrite, custom response header, or
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   server-side session. routing is hash-based, and the project does not claim a custom header
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   policy.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z + - **cross-browser coverage is uneven.** the full automated journey runs in chromium at three
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   viewports. firefox and webkit run a smoke path at desktop size, so use the human journey for
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   real-device confidence.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z + - **the board target is 150 cards.** the app warns softly at 120 cards and persistently at 150 or
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   more and never imposes a hard cap below 200. older tablets can still drop frames at the upper
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   end; the tablet frame-rate check is a human gate.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z + - **there is one local install per browser profile.** cases do not follow a student to another
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   device. moving a case means exporting it and importing it on the other device.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z + - **v1 excludes pdf import, photo annotation, typed note bodies, multi-image cards, card colors,
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   string labels, cross-case card reuse, case duplication, and whole-library export.**
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z + - **updates wait for confirmation.** a new service worker stays waiting until the in-app
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   **refresh** action is used; it does not activate silently during an open form.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z + - **no remote diagnostics.** with no telemetry, a defect must be reproduced locally and described
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +   in the review; there is no crash report to inspect.
[engine] harness activity stderr task=REL-4 attempt=1 at=2026-10-26T21:40:23.711Z +
